<title>USA: U.S. barge rates lightly traded on call session.</title>
<headline>U.S. barge rates lightly traded on call session.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barge rates were lightly traded on Thursday on the St. Louis Merchants Exchange call session. Four barges traded versus eight on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Trades included: - Four barges, two each week of September 22 and 29, mid-Mississippi (McGregor and South), bid 190 percent of tariff,trade.</p>
</text>
